Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.87,0:23:10.83,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}明日は七色　君と甘色
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.83,0:23:13.92,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}Wow Yes
